        <notes>
          <body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
            <p>Activity of CYP3A4 relative to the reference (*1/*1), changed
by the genotype and by inhibitors and inducers:
f_cyp3a4 = 1: normal activity;
f_cyp3a4 &lt; 1: reduced activity, inhibition of CYP3A4;
f_cyp3a4 &gt; 1: increased activity, induction of CYP3A4.</p>
          </body>
        </notes>
      </parameter>
