        <notes>
          <body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
            <p>The fraction of functional CYP3A5 alleles: *3/*3 = 0 (no
functional CYP3A5, the reference, most Caucasians), *1/*3 =
0.5, *1/*1 = 1.</p>
          </body>
        </notes>
      </parameter>
